       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIMPLE-INTEREST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRINCIPAL PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 RATE PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 TIME-PERIOD PIC 9(3).
       01 INTEREST-VALUE PIC 9(9)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter principal: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT PRINCIPAL.
           DISPLAY "Enter rate: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT RATE.
           DISPLAY "Enter time: " WITH NO ADVANCING. ACCEPT TIME-PERIOD.
           COMPUTE INTEREST-VALUE = PRINCIPAL * RATE * TIME-PERIOD / 100.
           DISPLAY "Simple interest: " INTEREST-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
